Z||000000||Dan86gt3.8||03-15-2000||11:31 PM||||Yes, I was reading a post earlier, where a couple members were discussing dealings with a fiero vender.  As far as the matter goes I am neutral, but towards the end of the post a member told 2 other members to leave the forum and not come back.  I personally love this forum and want to see it grow and get new members of any age, sex, location, or whatever.  So needles to say I was thoroughly po'ed to see that a rouge member told 2 people to leave, and  not come back.  How can we ever build a fiero community, if people do crap like that?  If I had the power to, I would revoke said members screename and never let HIM back on the site again.  Needless to say, I don't have that power but I think apologies are owed to the 2 members told to leave.  So does anyone else think that it is ok for members to tell other to leave for doing nothing wrong, or not intentionally stirring up trouble?  I felt this post was VERY NESSACARY and am still not happy with this member, and I am sure you know who you are.||||reg||8
